    {
      "id": "montpellier-day1-evening-2026",
      "category": "International",
      "headline": "Félix Lebrun and Chen Yi win openers at WTT Champions Montpellier as Matsushima survives Qiu",
      "summary": "Félix Lebrun beat Denmark's Anders Lind 11-8, 11-3, 11-3 and Chen Yi recovered from losing the first game to beat Peng Yu-han 3-1 on the first evening of WTT Champions Montpellier. The top seed, Sora Matsushima, beat Dang Qiu 11-2 in the deciding game.",
      "body": [
        "Lebrun won 14 of the next 17 points after taking a tight first game, and plays Oh Junsung or Zhou Qihao in the last 16. Chen lost the first game 12-10 from 9-8 up, then dropped only 12 points in the next three. She meets Wang Manyu or Hana Goda next.",
        "Matsushima led Qiu by two games and lost the next two 11-3 and 12-10 before taking the decider. Elizabeta Samara knocked out Germany's Han Ying 11-8, 11-4, 8-11, 11-7, and Truls Moregard beat Thibault Poret 11-8, 11-6, 11-8 but reached for his shoulder during the third game. It is not clear how serious the problem is.",
        "Earlier, Lin Yun-Ju came from 2-1 down to beat Portugal's João Geraldo 8-11, 11-4, 5-11, 11-4, 11-6."
      ],
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "published": "2026-10-27T21:58:00Z",
