    {
      "id": "montpellier-day1-sun-lin-2026",
      "category": "International",
      "headline": "Sun Yingsha and Lin Shidong sweep into last 16 at WTT Champions Montpellier",
      "summary": "Sun Yingsha beat France's Camille Lutz 11-6, 11-5, 11-3 in her first match for about three weeks, and Lin Shidong beat South Korea's Lim Jonghoon 3-0 on the opening day of WTT Champions Montpellier.",
      "body": [
        "Sun conceded 14 points against Lutz. Her previous match was a last-32 defeat at the China Smash, after which she missed the Asian Championships. She said afterwards, in comments carried by Sina Sports, that injury and illness had disrupted her training and that she had returned to a normal routine only about 10 days before travelling. She plays South Korea's Shin Yubin next.",
        "Lin beat Lim 11-7, 11-8, 11-2 in about 21 minutes, recovering from 0-6 down in the second game. He meets An Jaehyun, who beat Egypt's Omar Assar 3-2.",
        "Hina Hayata beat Hong Kong's Doo Hoi Kem 11-9, 11-7, 11-9, coming back from 3-8 down in the first game, and plays Bernadette Szőcs next. The Romanian beat South Korea's Kim Nayeong 11-7, 12-10, 11-9."
      ],
